s & uerra (which includes encodings for carra/cerra) include entries for Mean 2 metre temperature. The specific encoding for Mean 2 metre temperature can be found in 228004."}, "unit": {"symbol": "K"}, "observedProperty": {"id": "2t", "label": {"en": "2 metre temperature"}}}}}